nt and  the NHS when it cast is sworn to secrecy  while filming one of the world's hottest  shows and far-flung locations it's only  natural that they'd become close friends  Clark is no exception  Daenerys started off the series with a  wedding to Khal Drogo played by future  Aquaman star Jason Momoa the two became  fast friends while they were quartered  in Morocco together though Drogo is dead  by the end of the first season Momoa and  Clark have remained very close in fact  they refer to each other as quote the  moon of my life and my Sun and stars  to this day Momoa seems like one of  Clark's biggest supporters and fans are  always delighted by their reunions which  have taken place at major award shows  and Comic Con where Momoa made a  surprise appearance that did indeed  succeed in startling Clark  now as the show ends Clark will almost  certainly be closing out her character  storyline alongside Kit Harington he of  course plays the brooding Jon Snow the  presumed bastard who's actually Daenerys  Boyle nephew and her lover yep luckily  she and Harrington seem to be having a  great time together on set especially  when they're joking around about their  love scenes I mean I think kind of might  be the reaction  I like looking here and going oh my god  I'm sorry the pair have been friends  since the first season and each of them  is excited to finish the series with a  friend at their side as that heiress  Clark is no stranger to travelling  through foreign lands often on foot at  the beginning of Game of Thrones she  begins a long journey from the native  land of the Dothraki warrior clan  located across the Narrow Sea from  Westeros in order to finally take back  the iron throne at the Seven Kingdoms  she gets turned around several times  over ending up in slavers Bay and  subsequently taking control of several  slave cities before finally ending up in  Westeros in the seventh season thanks to  this storyline Clark herself has gotten  to travel to several e